+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 — Greenfield TodoMVC
+
+**User intent:** Build a TodoMVC app per `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as base markup. Vanilla JavaScript, no preprocessors, persists to localStorage.
+
+**Stack:** Plain JS in browser, Cucumber + happy-dom for verification.
+
+**Spec:** `features/todomvc-app.feature` — 26 scenarios covering add, complete, edit, delete, clear-completed, counter, filtering, persistence, and visibility.
+
+**Rigging note:** No `RIGGING.md` yet. The five required values (language: JavaScript, runtime: browser, packageManager: npm, implementation dir: root, specs dir: features) are discoverable. Rigging will be written during fitting out at harbour.
