@@ -0,0 +1,193 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC application
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want a single-page todo list application
+  So that I can track, complete, and organise my work
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Adding todos
+
+    Scenario: Add a new todo by pressing Enter
+      Given the todo list is empty
+      When the user types "Buy groceries" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And the new-todo input is empty
+      And the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+    Scenario: Trim whitespace from new todo titles
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user types "  Buy groceries  " into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Empty input is not added as a todo
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user presses Enter without typing anything
+      Then no todo is added to the list
+
+  Rule: Completing todos
+
+    Scenario: Mark a single todo as completed
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy groceries"
+      Then todo "Buy groceries" is marked as completed
+      And the item count shows "0 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Unmark a completed todo
+      Given the user has added completed todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy groceries"
+      Then todo "Buy groceries" is not marked as completed
+      And the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+    Scenario: Mark all todos as completed
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added todo "Walk the dog"
+      When the user toggles the Mark all as complete checkbox
+      Then all todos are marked as completed
+      And the item count shows "0 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Unmark all todos via Mark all as complete
+      Given the user has added completed todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Walk the dog"
+      When the user toggles the Mark all as complete checkbox
+      Then no todo is marked as completed
+      And the item count shows "2 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Mark all checkbox is unchecked when not all todos are completed
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added todo "Walk the dog"
+      When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy groceries"
+      Then the Mark all as complete checkbox is not checked
+
+    Scenario: Mark all checkbox is checked when all todos are completed
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added todo "Walk the dog"
+      When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Walk the dog"
+      Then the Mark all as complete checkbox is checked
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+    Scenario: Activate editing mode on double-click
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      Then todo "Buy groceries" is in editing mode
+
+    Scenario: Save edit on Enter
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user types "Buy milk" into the edit input and presses Enter
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+      And todo "Buy milk" is not in editing mode
+
+    Scenario: Save edit on blur
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user types "Buy milk" into the edit input and blurs
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Delete todo when edit is empty
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+      Then no todo "Buy groceries" exists
+
+    Scenario: Discard edit on Escape
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user types "Buy milk" into the edit input and presses Escape
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And todo "Buy groceries" is not in editing mode
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+    Scenario: Remove a todo by clicking its destroy button
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user clicks the destroy button for todo "Buy groceries"
+      Then no todo "Buy groceries" exists
+      And the todo list is empty
+
+  Rule: Clearing completed todos
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed removes finished todos
+      Given the user has added completed todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added todo "Walk the dog"
+      When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+      Then no todo "Buy groceries" exists
+      And a todo "Walk the dog" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the app is loaded
+      Then the Clear completed button is hidden
+
+  Rule: Counter
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows correct active count
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Read a book"
+      When the app is loaded
+      Then the item count shows "2 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter pluralises correctly
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the app is loaded
+      Then the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Rule: Filtering
+
+    Scenario: Filter shows all todos by default
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Read a book"
+      When the user navigates to "#/"
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And a todo "Read a book" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Active filter shows only incomplete todos
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Read a book"
+      When the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And no todo "Read a book" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Completed filter shows only completed todos
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Read a book"
+      When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+      Then no todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And a todo "Read a book" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Active filter link is selected when hash is #/active
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then the "Active" filter link is selected
+
+    Scenario: Completed filter hides the Clear completed button when empty
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+      Then the Clear completed button is hidden
+
+  Rule: Persistence
+
+    Scenario: Todos persist across page reload
+      Given the user has added todo "Buy groceries"
+      And the user has added completed todo "Read a book"
+      When the app is reloaded
+      Then a todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+      And a todo "Read a book" appears in the list
+      And the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Rule: Visibility
+
+    Scenario: Main section and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+      Given the todo list is empty
+      When the app is loaded
+      Then the main section is hidden
+      And the footer is hidden
+
+    Scenario: Main section and footer appear when a todo is added
+      Given the todo list is empty
+      When the user types "Buy groceries" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then the main section is visible
+      And the footer is visible
